---
import { teamPrinciples } from '../lib/perspectives';
---

<section
  id="ai-native-teams"
  class="team-model"
  aria-labelledby="team-model-title"
>
  <div class="model-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">MY VIEW / AI-NATIVE TEAMS</p>
    <h3 id="team-model-title">
      AI-native is an<br /><em>operating model.</em>
    </h3>
    <p class="model-lead">
      Faster code generation won’t fix a slow review queue. Redesign the whole
      path from a clear request to a verified result.
    </p>
    <p class="model-measure">
      <span class="eyebrow">MEASURE WHAT CHANGES</span>Lead time. Review
      waiting. Rework.<br />Not prompts sent or lines generated.
    </p>
  </div>
  <ol class="model-principles">
    {
      teamPrinciples.map((principle, index) => (
        <li>
          <span class="principle-number" aria-hidden="true">
            0{index + 1}
          </span>
          <div>
            <>
              <h4>{principle.title}</h4>
              <p>{principle.body}</p>
            </>
          </div>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ol>
  <div class="model-challenge">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">CHANGE THE METHOD. KEEP THE QUALITY BAR.</span><h4>
        Set an <em>“impossible goal”.</em>
      </h4>
    </div>
    <p>
      A challenge the old way can’t meet makes room for a new one. Missing the
      target is allowed; skipping checks or working longer isn’t the answer.
      Keep what works as shared practice—not a performance quota.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .team-model {
    margin-top: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    padding: clamp(20px, 3vw, 44px);
    background: #eceee2;
    border: 1px solid #ced3be;
    border-radius: 5px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1.1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem 3rem;
  }
  .model-intro > .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    color: #5a634e;
  }
  .model-intro h3 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.4vw, 3.35rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }
  .model-lead {
    max-width: 25rem;
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #515949;
  }
  .model-measure {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    border-left: 3px solid #b1bd63;
    padding-left: 1rem;
  }
  .model-measure .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.53rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.55rem;
    color: #5a634e;
  }
  .model-principles {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.45rem;
  }
  .model-principles li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.8rem;
  }
  .principle-number {
    font: 0.6rem/1.5 var(--mono);
    color: #5a634e;
    padding-top: 0.12rem;
  }
  .model-principles h4 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }
  .model-principles p {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: #515949;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .model-challenge {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1.1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem 3rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #c3cbb1;
    padding-top: 1.6rem;
  }
  .model-challenge .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.52rem;
    color: #5a634e;
  }
  .model-challenge h4 {
    margin: 0.6rem 0 0;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }
  .model-challenge p {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #515949;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .team-model,
    .model-challenge {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .model-intro h3 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    }
    .model-lead {
      max-width: 38rem;
    }
    .model-measure {
      margin-top: 1.3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
